english:
A fast, slightly homing grenade with a light trajectory that sticks to enemies or surfaces. It explodes 1.2 seconds after attaching, then explodes again 0.6 seconds later.

Each explosion deals up to <pve 472 /> <pvp [75] /> damage in a 5 meter radius.

// The source lists 472 [75] damage per explosion and a conflicting combined figure of 946 [150]. The discrepancy is unresolved.
